text.section:
It shall be unlawful for any person to engage in any of the following acts:

Operate as a driver improvement clinic or as an instructor without holding a valid license as required by statute or regulation;


Make use of any designation provided by statute or regulation to denote a standard of professional or occupational competence without being duly licensed;


Perform any act or function that is restricted by statute or regulation to persons holding a driver improvement clinic or instructor license, without being duly licensed;


Materially misrepresenting facts in an application for a license;


Willfully refusing to furnish the Department information or records required or requested pursuant to statute, regulation, or criteria established by the Department pursuant to § 46.2-490.
